{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Reunion", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "John's Big Announcement", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 18, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Jobs and Work", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A common topic for small talk in English is jobs and work. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: What do you do? <br>   <span class=\"strong\">Sam</span>: I work in advertising. My office is on Main Street. I really enjoy it. I can't complain! How about you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can ask about someone's job using the question <span class=\"italic\">What do you do? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "This is generally a \u2018safe' topic and one that many people like to talk about.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You usually give a brief description of the job, the location of the job and your opinion of it.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The First Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Gloria</span>: If he gets married, we'll never see him.<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I know!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do   something. In that condition, something else will happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">If </span> clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Main Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If he gets married,\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" we will never see him.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If they get married, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he will have to get a better apartment.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shift ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of time you work at a job ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have long shifts at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "benefit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a form of additional payment at work (vacation time, pension, health care)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: We have great benefits at work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be engaged", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to promise to marry someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John and Sandra are engaged.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to propose ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask someone to marry you ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: John proposed to Sandra.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to complain", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to express feelings of pain or unhappiness ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can't complain about my job - it is great.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le18ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you have some good news.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an e-mail to a partner telling them all about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to read your e-mail out loud. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write an e-mail about some good news.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I send it to my partner", "type": "text"}, {"content": "My partner reads the e-mail aloud and we talk about it.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le18ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "2000", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, hey. It's an e-mail from John.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What does it say?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi, Peter. How's life? Work is good on the cruise ship. We have long shifts, but great benefits. I can't complain! Life is getting interesting for me. I have some news for you. Sandra and I are engaged! That's right - we're getting married. Crazy, eh? I proposed yesterday and she said yes! I'll buy a ring next week. Call me later so we can talk about it. Say hi to Sal and V for me too. Talk to you soon, John."}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "33500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What? He's engaged? Wow!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know! I can't believe it! If he gets married, we will never see him! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, we never see him anyway. He works on a cruise ship."}, {"image": "engenn5le18ob10re2img06.jpg", "time"